{"synopsis":"Di dunia ini, ada orang-orang yang disebut Awakeners. Mereka memiliki kekuatan fisik dan kemampuan khusus nan luar biasa. Kannagi Minato, yang setiap hari selalu ditindas, tiba-tiba terjebak dalam situasi hidup dan mati. Saat berada di ujung tanduk, dia mendadak bangkit lagi. Ternyata, di dalam dirinya terdapat roh-roh pahlawan pendiri dunia yang dulu pernah menyelamatkan dunia. Sejak itu, hidupnya berubah drastis.\n\nDari penulis terkenal Etou Shunji, pencipta karya hit “Savior of Divine God Draw Out 0.00000001% To Become the Strongest”!","alternative_title":"나만 최강 초월자 입니다","author":"ETOU Shunji","artist":"3rd Ie, Studio No.9, Fuuwai, TSUCHIDA Kenta","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"41ac80cf-2741-4245-892d-0fc905a11585","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_83/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_69b87d95-cffb-4d31-b655-d502deaff063/chapter_ch_8